(7596140, 1225906, 124815, '<td valign="top">This image is calculated exactly to the letter phi! Golden mean, golden/rosy clouds. The composition rules here even if the image is not mold breaking</td>', 'This image is calculated exactly to the letter phi! Golden mean, golden/rosy clouds. The composition rules here even if the image is not mold breaking', '2018-09-12 14:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
