(7596187, 1226114, 124815, '<td valign="top">Quite a conundrum here and a very appealing one. 7 A great find and I believe that more horizontal space would have benefited it<br/> <br/>On a side note about composition: you aspired to a golden mean but did not quite get it.<br/>Easy to determine where you failed it: <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1226149" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/120000-124999/124815/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1226149.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/120000-124999/124815/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1226149.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/120000-124999/124815/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1226149.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Quite a conundrum here and a very appealing one. 7 A great find and I believe that more horizontal space would have benefited it On a side note about composition: you aspired to a golden mean but did not quite get it.Easy to determine where you failed it: ', '2018-09-12 21:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7596201, 1225870, 114285, '<td valign="top">Thats a very unique take on the stairwell theme, it pops!</td>', 'Thats a very unique take on the stairwell theme, it pops!', '2018-09-12 21:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7596222, 1226071, 104230, '<td valign="top">Be still my heart!   My parents retired to the village of Dittisham on the river Dart, and that is where I''d return after I''d emigrated to Canada and subsequently to the USA.<br/> <br/>Good catch, I don''t recall the water being this smooth very often, but then we were often hoping for enough wind to be able to sail.<br/> <br/>I wonder if  these are the moorings up by Stoke Gabriel?  The Drascombe Lugger sail boat my father had was on a running mooring, so a close watch on the tide timetable and a willingness to wade in the mud sometimes was all part of the routine.<br/> <br/>I hope you had a wonderful outing!<br/> <br/>Not voting just yet.</td>', 'Be still my heart!   My parents retired to the village of Dittisham on the river Dart, and that is where I''d return after I''d emigrated to Canada and subsequently to the USA. Good catch, I don''t recall the water being this smooth very often, but then we were often hoping for enough wind to be able to sail. I wonder if  these are the moorings up by Stoke Gabriel?  The Drascombe Lugger sail boat my father had was on a running mooring, so a close watch on the tide timetable and a willingness to wade in the mud sometimes was all part of the routine. I hope you had a wonderful outing! Not voting just yet.', '2018-09-12 23:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
